## Executive Summary

TechSecure Inc. is committed to maintaining the highest standards of cybersecurity to protect its data, assets, and customer information. This document outlines the potential threats to our organization, the defenses currently in place, compliance requirements, and our incident response plan. Our goal is to ensure the resilience of our operations against cyber threats while adhering to industry regulations.

