| Threat Type         | Description                                               | Likelihood (1-5) | Impact (1-5) | Priority Level (1-5) |
|---------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|------------------|--------------|----------------------|
| Phishing Attacks    | Targeted emails to extract sensitive information          | 4                | 5            | 5                    |
| Ransomware          | Malicious software that encrypts files for ransom        | 3                | 5            | 4                    |
| Insider Threats     | Employees misusing access to confidential information     | 2                | 4            | 3                    |
| DDoS Attacks        | Distributed denial-of-service aimed at disrupting services| 3                | 3            | 3                    |
| Supply Chain Attacks| Compromised vendors providing malware-laden software      | 4                | 4            | 4                    |
| Data Breaches       | Unauthorized access to sensitive customer data           | 3                | 5            | 4                    |

