## 4. Incident Response Plan

TechSecure Inc. has established a robust Incident Response Plan (IRP) to handle security incidents effectively. The plan consists of the following phases:

### 4.1 Incident Response Phases

| Phase                     | Description                                   | Responsible Entity         | Timeline         |
|---------------------------|-----------------------------------------------|-----------------------------|------------------|
| Preparation               | Develop and train response teams              | CISO, IT Security Team      | Ongoing          |
| Identification            | Detect and assess incidents                    | Security Operations Center  | Immediate        |
| Containment               | Limit the impact of the incident               | IT Security Team            | Within 1 hour    |
| Eradication               | Remove the cause of the incident               | IT Security Team            | Within 24 hours  |
| Recovery                  | Restore systems and resume operations          | IT Support Team             | Within 48 hours  |
| Lessons Learned           | Analyze the incident and improve processes     | CISO, Compliance Team       | Within 1 week    |

